          <commentary>공식 정답과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>중심 각주파수 $\omega_{o} = \frac{1}{RC}$ [rad/s]이다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>공식 정답과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>중심 각주파수에서 전압이득 $\left| K \right| = 2$이다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>공식 정답에 따르면 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>대역폭(bandwidth) $BW = \frac{1}{\pi RC}$ [Hz]이다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>공식 정답과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
